  "why_the_earlier_probe_missed_it": "reports/openrouter-rate-limit-probe/ sampled one question (question-002) three times and saw finish_reason 'stop'. question-002 turns out to be the shortest of the 15 (744 completion tokens). One question does not characterise the set.",
